{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_013_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a0c3a024a323ec472cc83edffc63e81d6aba23963044180ff0d46dd1018d7b1d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff195adc7d5b608c440dc1de7cb750930bc586dc6a93f5bff6eb3a26ee43879",
      "text": "（……白色情人节的回礼，\n想送监督会喜欢的东西呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01be3936ffc8b32018704279852c85fd00d61acfde85fc78caa75079c8296c19",
      "text": "（监督喜欢什么呢。平时送我的都是合我心意的东西，\n难道说，监督跟我的喜好很相近？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aa7030de015a77113652f9808d66a1154b83604ba8f5fcacd428c4e8d685457",
      "text": "我说啊，监督。你在情人节送我的巧克力，\n是选了自己喜欢的口味吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47fca8592a9a0aee886596cfc9da70adedc492be637cb9ba87d5ee7ad6582624",
      "text": "我是想着享介先生喜欢的东西去挑选的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:827754a91d3942f6f76c5b6711645fb094ee5235118eafcbc7e8826955799bb9",
      "text": "原来是这样吗？我还以为……没有啦。\n没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdc4dc9da4bb71329e631d486398b5ea8d86152f66f93447b12ad83c5f44ef94",
      "text": "（这么说来，是监督特意为了我\n做了各种各样的调查啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4346b064a054e10a5369e94b673bcb3c82490dbbdbe8af82e8d6f3c14837cc45",
      "text": "（这样啊～……原来是这样啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3040e2ecca30377802e1be294bebcc04cb1093ca8d5b67d8c6d36d0811956156",
      "text": "享介先生？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d9cb390b0e54759fcb44a0356253b686212eef429e12acb4adf14f321e51a97",
      "text": "诶？没有没有，没什么啦。因为那个巧克力\n实在太好吃了，所以才想问问看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b785b59874bccb4c2e4b67074185689e0ae8ac43fba033ade47439b0469fbcb3",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！那真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_013_23:5_01_013_23_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abad70158d896a8221227b763e386dcfc09a4f783e9448455ec735dac91fb752",
      "text": "白色情人节我也要送能让监督忍不住想问理由的好东西哦。\n敬请期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
